*******1. Login Page********

DISPLAY Login Page

ASK user to enter:
    Email
    Password

DISPLAY "Sign In"
DISPLAY "Forgot Password?"
DISPLAY "Sign Up"

IF user clicks "Sign Up" THEN
    GO TO Registration Page
END IF

IF user clicks "Forgot Password?" THEN
    GO TO Forgot/Reset Password Page
END IF

IF user clicks "Sign In" THEN

    CHECK that Email and Password are not empty

    IF Email OR Password is empty THEN
        DISPLAY "Please enter your email and password"
    ELSE
        SEND Email and Password to Firebase Authentication

        IF login is successful THEN
            CHECK account type

            IF account type is Learner THEN
                GO TO Learner Dashboard
            ELSE IF account type is Facilitator THEN
                GO TO Facilitator Dashboard
            END IF

        ELSE
            DISPLAY "Invalid email or password"
        END IF
    END IF
END IF

*********2. Registration and OTP**********

DISPLAY Registration Page

ASK user to enter:
    Email
    Username
    Phone Number
    Account Type
    Password

DISPLAY Account Type:
    Learner
    Facilitator

IF user clicks "Create Account" THEN

    VALIDATE all registration information

    IF any required information is missing THEN
        DISPLAY "Please complete all fields"

    ELSE IF password does not meet requirements THEN
        DISPLAY "Password must contain at least 6 characters"

    ELSE
        SEND registration information to Firebase

        GENERATE OTP

        DISPLAY OTP Verification section

        ASK user to choose:
            Email OTP
            Phone OTP

        SEND OTP to selected method
    END IF
END IF

ASK user to enter OTP

IF entered OTP is correct THEN

    CREATE and verify Firebase account

    SAVE user information to Firebase Realtime Database

    DISPLAY "Account created successfully"

    RETURN user to Login Page

ELSE
    DISPLAY "Incorrect OTP"
    ALLOW user to request another OTP
END IF


**********3. Forgot / Reset Password************

DISPLAY Forgot/Reset Password Page

ASK user to enter:
    Account Email
    Phone Number or verification information

ASK user to select:
    Email OTP
    Phone OTP

IF user clicks "Reset Password" THEN

    CHECK whether account exists in Firebase

    IF account exists THEN

        GENERATE OTP

        SEND OTP to selected email or phone

        ASK user to enter OTP

        IF OTP is correct THEN

            ASK user to enter a new password

            VALIDATE new password

            IF password is valid THEN
                UPDATE password in Firebase Authentication

                DISPLAY "Password reset successfully"

                RETURN user to Login Page
            ELSE
                DISPLAY "Password does not meet requirements"
            END IF

        ELSE
            DISPLAY "Invalid OTP"
        END IF

    ELSE
        DISPLAY "Account not found"
    END IF
END IF

************4. Return to Login***********

IF registration is successful THEN
    RETURN to Login Page
END IF

IF password reset is successful THEN
    RETURN to Login Page
END IF

DISPLAY:
    Email field
    Password field
    Sign In button
    Sign Up option
    Forgot Password option


************5. Firebase Processing**********

WHEN the user submits information:

    JAVASCRIPT receives the form data

    VALIDATE the information

    SEND request through Firebase SDK

    FIREBASE AUTHENTICATION:
        Create account
        Verify account
        Login user
        Reset password

    FIREBASE REALTIME DATABASE:
        Store user information
        Retrieve user information

    FIREBASE returns a response

    JAVASCRIPT receives the response

    IF response is successful THEN
        UPDATE the webpage
        DISPLAY success message
        REDIRECT user to the correct dashboard

    ELSE
        DISPLAY an error message
    END IF


************6. Dashboard***********

IF Firebase Authentication confirms successful login THEN

    RETRIEVE user's account type from Firebase

    IF account type = "Learner" THEN
        DISPLAY Learner Dashboard

    ELSE IF account type = "Facilitator" THEN
        DISPLAY Facilitator Dashboard
    END IF

END IF

END

